{"id":"ed20d679e3199320","group":"28","path":"28/28-thm-tqbf-pspace-complete.md","title":"TQBF is PSPACE-Complete","display":"thm-tqbf-pspace-complete — TQBF is PSPACE-Complete","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-thm-tqbf-pspace-complete","aliases":["28-thm-tqbf-pspace-complete","TQBF is PSPACE-Complete"],"display":"thm-tqbf-pspace-complete — TQBF is PSPACE-Complete","depends_on":["[[28-df-tqbf]]","[[28-df-pspace-complete]]","[[28-df-poly-reduction]]","[[28-df-configuration-graph]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-thm-tqbf-pspace-complete"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-thm-tqbf-pspace-complete</span><span>TQBF is PSPACE-Complete</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-tqbf-pspace-complete — TQBF is PSPACE-Complete"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e3545f8c2a4ed307\" href=\"?note=e3545f8c2a4ed307\" title=\"28-df-tqbf\">28-df-tqbf</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a39964177c0e0048\" href=\"?note=a39964177c0e0048\" title=\"28-df-pspace-complete\">28-df-pspace-complete</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"14088421136f8182\" href=\"?note=14088421136f8182\" title=\"28-df-poly-reduction\">28-df-poly-reduction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1b4d0bd43db4c9c9\" href=\"?note=1b4d0bd43db4c9c9\" title=\"28-df-configuration-graph\">28-df-configuration-graph</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TQBF}\">\\(\\mathrm{TQBF}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{PSPACE}\">\\(\\mathbf{PSPACE}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PSPACEComplete}\">\\(\\mathrm{PSPACEComplete}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le_m^{\\mathbf P}\">\\(\\le_m^{\\mathbf P}\\)</span> 见本目录定义。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TQBF}\\in\\mathrm{PSPACEComplete}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{TQBF}\\in\\mathrm{PSPACEComplete}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>成员资格由深度优先递归求量词真值，保存当前部分赋值并复用递归空间。难性将多项式空间机器的配置路径压缩为 QBF：若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi_i(C,C&#39;)\">\\(\\psi_i(C,C&#39;)\\)</span> 表示长至多 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^i\">\\(2^i\\)</span> 的路径，朴素双拷贝递归会指数膨胀；改为存在中点 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\">\\(W\\)</span>、全称端点对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_1,D_2\">\\(D_1,D_2\\)</span>，仅在该对等于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(C,W)\">\\((C,W)\\)</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(W,C&#39;)\">\\((W,C&#39;)\\)</span> 时要求单一拷贝的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi_{i-1}(D_1,D_2)\">\\(\\psi_{i-1}(D_1,D_2)\\)</span>。每层只增 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O(m)\">\\(O(m)\\)</span> 符号，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m=O(s(n))\">\\(m=O(s(n))\\)</span> 层得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O(m^2)\">\\(O(m^2)\\)</span> 大小。基例需加入端点相等以覆盖零步路径，最后把接受配置统一后代入起终点。</p>\n<p>来源核对：定理4.13及证明；印刷84–85页；PDF110–111页。陈述、空间复用及避免公式双拷贝的压缩证明已核对。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-tqbf","status":"resolved","id":"e3545f8c2a4ed307","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-tqbf]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-pspace-complete","status":"resolved","id":"a39964177c0e0048","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-pspace-complete]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-poly-reduction","status":"resolved","id":"14088421136f8182","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-poly-reduction]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-configuration-graph","status":"resolved","id":"1b4d0bd43db4c9c9","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-configuration-graph]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{TQBF}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{PSPACE}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PSPACEComplete}","display":false},{"tex":"\\le_m^{\\mathbf P}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TQBF}\\in\\mathrm{PSPACEComplete}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\psi_i(C,C')","display":false},{"tex":"2^i","display":false},{"tex":"W","display":false},{"tex":"D_1,D_2","display":false},{"tex":"(C,W)","display":false},{"tex":"(W,C')","display":false},{"tex":"\\psi_{i-1}(D_1,D_2)","display":false},{"tex":"O(m)","display":false},{"tex":"m=O(s(n))","display":false},{"tex":"O(m^2)","display":false}],"bytes":1388,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-72","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"空间完全问题：[[28-df-path]]、[[28-thm-path-nl-complete]]、[[28-df-tqbf]]、[[28-thm-tqbf-pspace-complete]]。"},{"id":"13847817d539efaf","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["e3545f8c2a4ed307","a39964177c0e0048","14088421136f8182","1b4d0bd43db4c9c9"]}